sequenceDiagram
    participant User as AgenticAiView (Query Step)
    participant CM as ContextManager
    participant Store as VectorStore
    participant Emb as Embedder (query)
    participant Coll as ChromaDB Collection
    participant Fuse as Fusion Engine

    User->>CM: getContext(query, { currentFile })
    CM->>Store: search(query, { topK, filters })

    Store->>Store: emit('progress', { phase: 'search', status: 'start' })

    Note over Store,Coll: Three strategies run in parallel

    par Exact Match
        Store->>Coll: collection.get({ limit: 1000 })
        Coll-->>Store: All documents + metadata
        Store->>Store: findExactMatches(query, items, filters)
        Note over Store: Match against functionName,<br/>className, methodName,<br/>variableName, exact phrase
    and Semantic Search
        Store->>Emb: embed(query)
        Emb-->>Store: Query vector
        Store->>Coll: collection.query({ queryEmbeddings, nResults })
        Coll-->>Store: Nearest neighbours + distances
        Store->>Store: semanticSearch → score = 1 - distance
    and Keyword Search
        Store->>Store: tokeniseQuery(query) → keywords
        Store->>Store: keywordSearch(keywords, items, filters)
        Note over Store: Token matching with<br/>length bonus scoring
    end

    Store->>Store: emit('progress', { phase: 'search', status: 'progress' })

    Store->>Fuse: fuseResults(exact, semantic, keyword, weights)
    Note over Fuse: Weights: exact 0.4, semantic 0.4, keyword 0.2
    Fuse->>Fuse: Deduplicate by source_file + startRow + endRow
    Fuse->>Fuse: Sum weighted scores per chunk
    Fuse->>Fuse: getRanked(fused, topK, minSimilarity)
    Note over Fuse: Survive if fusedScore ≥ min<br/>OR bestRawScore ≥ min<br/>Classes surface first
    Fuse-->>Store: Ranked results

    Store->>Store: Build SearchResult { results, groupedByFile, searchStats }
    Store->>Store: emit('progress', { phase: 'search', status: 'complete' })

    Store-->>CM: SearchResult
    CM-->>User: SearchResult

    Note over User: User reviews & selects context chunks

    participant Respond as AgenticAiView (Respond Step)
    participant LLM as OllamaClient

    User->>Respond: Navigate to Respond step
    Respond->>Respond: buildContextString() from selected chunks
    Respond->>Respond: _buildFullPrompt() = context + query
    Respond->>LLM: sendPrompt(fullPrompt)
    LLM-->>Respond: LLM response text
    Respond->>Respond: Typewriter render response
